# Variable Values Reference Card

## Quick Copy-Paste Commands

### HEADED Mode - Browser Visibility
```bash
# Show browser (headed)
npm run test:headed
HEADED=true npm test

# Hide browser (headless - default)
npm test
HEADED=false npm test
```

**Values:** `true` | `false`

---

### CUCUMBER_TAGS - Filter by Tags
```bash
# Single tag
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" npm test
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression" npm test
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical" npm test

# Multiple tags (AND)
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical" npm test
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression and @nonparallel" npm test

# Multiple tags (OR)
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke or @regression" npm test

# Exclude tags
CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @wip" npm test
CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @skip" npm test

# Complex expressions
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and not @wip" npm test
CUCUMBER_TAGS="(@smoke or @regression) and not @wip" npm test
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical and (@api or @ui)" npm test
```

**Values:** Any tag expression like:
- `@tag`
- `@tag1 and @tag2`
- `@tag1 or @tag2`
- `not @tag`
- Complex combinations

---

### CUCUMBER_WORKERS - Parallel Execution
```bash
# Serial execution (one test at a time)
npm test
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=0 npm test

# 2 parallel workers
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test

# 4 parallel workers (recommended default)
npm run test:parallel
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test

# 8 parallel workers (high-end systems)
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=8 npm test
```

**Values:** 
- `0` - Serial (sequential)
- `1` - Single worker
- `2` - 2 parallel
- `4` - 4 parallel (recommended)
- `8` - 8 parallel (requires strong system)

