## Combination Reference

### All Combinations with Values

```bash
# Format: HEADED | TAGS | WORKERS
# ================================

# Headless, All tests, Serial
npm test
HEADED=false CUCUMBER_TAGS="" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=0 npm test

# Headed, All tests, Serial
npm run test:headed
HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=0 npm test

# Headless, @smoke, Serial
npm run test:tags
HEADED=false CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=0 npm test

# Headed, @smoke, Serial
npm run test:tags:headed
HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=0 npm test

# Headless, All tests, 4 workers
npm run test:parallel
HEADED=false CUCUMBER_TAGS="" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test

# Headed, All tests, 4 workers
npm run test:parallel:headed
HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test

# Headless, @smoke, 4 workers
npm run test:tags:parallel
HEADED=false CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test

# Headed, @smoke, 4 workers
npm run test:tags:parallel:headed
HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

