## Variable Value Ranges

### HEADED
| Value | Result |
|-------|--------|
| `true` | Browser window opens |
| `false` | Headless/hidden browser |
| (not set) | `false` (headless) |

### CUCUMBER_TAGS
| Value | Example | Result |
|-------|---------|--------|
| (empty) | `CUCUMBER_TAGS=""` | All scenarios |
| `@tag` | `CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke"` | Only @smoke |
| `@tag1 and @tag2` | `CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical"` | Both tags |
| `@tag1 or @tag2` | `CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke or @regression"` | Either tag |
| `not @tag` | `CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @wip"` | Exclude tag |

### CUCUMBER_WORKERS
| Value | Workers | Result |
|-------|---------|--------|
| `0` | None | Serial execution |
| `1` | 1 | Single worker (quasi-serial) |
| `2` | 2 | 2 scenarios at once |
| `4` | 4 | 4 scenarios at once (default) |
| `8` | 8 | 8 scenarios at once |

