## Environment Variable Syntax

### Windows PowerShell
```powershell
$env:HEADED='true'
$env:CUCUMBER_TAGS='@smoke'
$env:CUCUMBER_WORKERS='4'
npm test
```

### Windows Command Prompt (cmd)
```cmd
set HEADED=true
set CUCUMBER_TAGS=@smoke
set CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4
npm test
```

### Mac/Linux Bash
```bash
export HEADED=true
export CUCUMBER_TAGS=@smoke
export CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4
npm test
```

### In npm scripts (package.json)
```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "test": "cross-env HEADED=false CUCUMBER_WORKERS=0 cucumber-js",
    "test:custom": "cross-env HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS=\"@smoke\" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 cucumber-js"
  }
}
```

