## Tag Expression Cheat Sheet

```bash
# Basic
@smoke                          # Single tag
@smoke @critical                # Multiple tags in file (space-separated)

# Logical operators
@smoke and @critical            # Both tags required
@smoke or @regression           # Either tag works
not @wip                        # Without tag

# Complex expressions
(@smoke or @regression)         # Grouped OR
@smoke and not @wip             # AND with NOT
(@smoke and @critical) or @fast # Multiple groups

# Real examples
@smoke and @critical            # Critical smoke tests
@regression and not @wip        # Regression tests, exclude WIP
@ui or @api                     # UI tests OR API tests
not @skip                       # Everything except skip
@performance and not @manual    # Performance, exclude manual
```

