## Values Summary Table

| Variable | Default | Valid Values | Example |
|----------|---------|--------------|---------|
| `HEADED` | `false` | `true`, `false` | `HEADED=true` |
| `CUCUMBER_TAGS` | `` (all) | Any tag expression | `CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke"` |
| `CUCUMBER_WORKERS` | `0` | `0-8` (adjust for system) | `CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4` |
| `CUCUMBER_PARALLEL` | Uses WORKERS | `true`, `false` | `CUCUMBER_PARALLEL=true` |
| `TRACE` | Not set | `all` or any value | `TRACE=all` |

